    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, that \"500 unit restock\" thing... i just checked the real-time inventory database for the Midnight Onyx line and it's actually showing over 5,000 units in stock right now. If we tell people there's only 500 left, aren't we going to get in trouble for lying about the stock levels? Can we adjust the captions to be just as urgent without using those specific numbers if they aren't accurate?",
